iano a trovarsi a fare lavori per i boss della malavita locale. Quando decidono di mettersi in proprio, il loro approccio disinvolto al crimine comincia a cambiare.","tagline":"Stanno cercando di ottenere ciò che vogliono. E quello che vogliono è tutto."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In 1930s Marseilles two small-time crooks decide to join forces when they meet while brawling over a woman. Starting with fixed horse races and boxing matches, they soon find themselves doing jobs for the local gangster bosses. When they decide to go into the business for themselves, their easy-going approach to crime starts to change.","tagline":"They're going after what they want. And what they want is everything."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Borsalino","overview":"Quand Roch Siffredi sort de prison, c’est d’abord pour aller se mesurer, par la force du poing, à François Capella. Mais les deux gangsters vont très vite comprendre que l’union fait la force, et qu’en s’associant ils peuvent voir grand, très grand. Ils multiplient les arnaques et les coups d’éclat dans un Marseille alors aux mains des puissants chefs de clan Pauli et Marcello…","tagline":"Grandeur et décadence du milieu marseillais"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zcZ5UILFQsko7NlIaEDpIsQvSlS.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gygNkDF0mTdVaaRO8nTeXvJwjFA.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":25251,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zcZ5UILFQsko7NlIaEDpIsQvSlS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zcZ5UILFQsko7NlIaEDpIsQvSlS.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zcZ5UILFQsko7NlIaEDpIsQvSlS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zcZ5UILFQsko7NlIaED